Adds POST /v1/providers/microsoft_teams_bot/events/verify, a verification-only endpoint like the Slack one. It checks the Bot Framework JWT (RS256 signature from published keys, issuer, audience = selected connection's appId, expiry, serviceUrl claim, key endorsement). The bot is selected with the same connection selectors as Actions. The Bot Framework token is forwarded in X-Botframework-Authorization because Authorization carries the dedicated verify token. Shared the event body reader and bearer check with the Slack route.
